   <narrative xml:lang="SV">International Alert 06-08</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Alert</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Organisational programme support to International Alert, an org working with peacebuilding. During 2007-2008 IAs directs its efforts to the Great Lakes region, Westafrica, Eurasia, Nepal, Sri Lanka, the Philippines, Lebanon, Sudan and a Peacebuilding Issues Programme (PIP). During the project period PIP focuses on aid effectiveness, climate change, gender, peace &amp; economy, and security.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Organisatoriskt programst&#xf6;d till org. som arbetar med fredsbyggande. Under 2006-2008 riktas IAs arbete huvudsakligen mot Stora sj&#xf6;regionen, V&#xe4;stafrika, Eurasien, Nepal, Sri Lanka, Filippinerna, Libanon, Sudan samt ett program f&#xf6;r peacebuilding issues (PIP). PIP fokuserar under perioden p&#xe5; bist&#xe5;ndseffektivitet, klimatf&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndring, genus, fred och ekonomi samt s&#xe4;kerhet.</narrative>
  </description>
